{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress","id":1249261,"title":"Where was the Scarlet Empress?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-27T20:20:51-07:00","id":1249261,"title":"Where was the Scarlet Empress?","content":"Where is the Scarlet Empress?<br /> Where was the Scarlet Empress?<br /> Where did the Scarlet Empress used to be when it was a mystery and -<br /> <br /> Ok, what I'm getting at is, what ideas did people have about where the Empress was back before it was defined in canon? There's things I like and don't like about her being kidnapped for the Reclamation, but I got into Exalted during 2e, I've seen heaps of discussion of that as canon and little else. I remember hearing this group talking about their game before I got into Exalted, and their idea was one of the things that drew my interest to the setting. They took turns storytelling, basically playing 3 games in the same setting - one was a group of Dragon-Blooded looking for the Empress, One was a group of Solars looking for the Empress, and one was a group of Abyssals looking for the Empress. They planned to play through a few stories of that and then decide which group would be the player characters in the final plot arc.<br /> <br /> I played in a game once where she returned, and her story was &quot;I was kidnapped by demons, but I freed myself and won these 50 totally-not-anathema servants from my captor in the process,&quot; giving the wedding guard a cover to act in Creation. That was kind of cool, but my understanding of the core qualities of the Scarlet Empress is that she's A) pretty badass and B) dedicated to protecting Creation (albeit ruthlessly.) So I find it hard to rationalise a plotline (for a game I'm running, I mean) where she's serving the Yozis willingly, or under their control. Maybe I could do something where she's pretending to co-operate while she prepares some stratagem to fight back, but that's a lot of time &amp; focus on her in a game that's not necessarily going to be centered on the Realm.<br /> <br /> Anyway, what other alternatives have people come up with?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-27T21:15:22-07:00","id":1249270,"title":"","content":"I got in about when Exalted: the Dragin Blooded came out so I never got to speculate before<br /> <br /> As for now, I have a few ideas. Will post some later when I'm on a computer with a keyboard","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-27T21:18:18-07:00","id":1249271,"title":"","content":"My current group has a running gag about how she just got fed up and retired to run a noodle stand.<br /> <br /> It's the greatest noodle stand in Creation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/21733-ascension","name":"Ascension","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar21733_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-27T22:53:05-07:00","id":1249278,"title":"","content":"In my game, she was assassinated by Lunars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T06:08:15-07:00","id":1249357,"title":"","content":"In my game she stepped through some kind of portal within the Sword or Creation and is gone. Elsewhere, Zen-Mu, who gives a shit, important is: she's gone and there is no way of telling if and when she'll be back which creates exactly the atmosphere I wanted at my table. Your mileage may vary.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/903-cheshire-cat","name":"Cheshire Cat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar903_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"502"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T06:35:21-07:00","id":1249372,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katamari_Naneke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress#post1249261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I played in a game once where she returned, and her story was &quot;I was kidnapped by demons, but I freed myself and won these 50 totally-not-anathema servants from my captor in the process,&quot; giving the wedding guard a cover to act in Creation. That was kind of cool, but my understanding of the core qualities of the Scarlet Empress is that she's A) pretty badass and B) dedicated to protecting Creation (albeit ruthlessly.) So I find it hard to rationalise a plotline (for a game I'm running, I mean) where she's serving the Yozis willingly, or under their control. Maybe I could do something where she's pretending to co-operate while she prepares some stratagem to fight back, but that's a lot of time &amp; focus on her in a game that's not necessarily going to be centered on the Realm.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a way of seeing it for certain. Another is that her protection was for utterly selfish, though human and valid, motives - the survival of her and the world she lives in, the consolidation of a world-ruling power base around the strategic position she managed to get into through snatching the Imperial Manse.<br /> <br /> Or alternately, she honestly cared deeply for her stewardship role over Creation. Once. But decades and centuries of success, stability and power may bring with it many temptations and ways to corrupt, changing a person in ways subtle and remarkable both. It's partly what lead into the Usurpation, no?<br /> <br /> Your view is pretty valid and it's your game anyway, but wanted to bring up some valid rationale for other views, that may be adressed either OoC or IC itself for the sake of conflict and drama.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T09:57:08-07:00","id":1249456,"title":"","content":"Turns out the real Scarlet Empress was inside us all along!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":20}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T19:03:08-07:00","id":1249591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1249372#post1249372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Your view is pretty valid and it's your game anyway, but wanted to bring up some valid rationale for other views, that may be adressed either OoC or IC itself for the sake of conflict and drama.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I guess that's true. And obviously other people's conception of the Empress are just as valid either way. I'm not opposed to casting her as a villain, I mean, look at all the horrors wrought in the name of the Realm. But I find it hard to stretch that as far as voluntarily working with the Yozis. Although, saying that has just given me the idea that maybe she made some terrible pact with them in order to gain power that made it possible for her to take up the Sword of Creation at all, and they've come to collect unexpectedly early. I still don't really like the idea of her being forced to marry the Ebon Dragon (I'm much more attached to her being badass than her being ultimately noble), and even if she wants to protect her world for selfish reasons, it's hard for me to imagine her getting behind the canon Reclamation. Do you care to elaborate on your view of her further?<br /> <br /> I also like <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/21733-ascension\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar21733_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"21733\" data-vbnamecard=\"21733\">Ascension</a>'s noodle stand idea. I dunno if I'll use it though. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T22:17:20-07:00","id":1249615,"title":"","content":"On a more serious note (compared the the noodle stand), one of the ideas I've toyed with in the past is having an assassinated Scarlet Empress refuse to die, accepting the mantle of a new Deathlord not with any intention to spread Oblivion and etcetera, but with a plan to turn the tables on the Neverborn and reclaim the Realm which was taken from her, a Scarlet Phoenix rising from the ashes.<br /> <br /> Aesthetically the idea of a risen Empress appeals to me, but I've never quite sold myself on the idea enough to try putting it in a game.<br /> <br /> I feel like, in general, the disappearance of the Empress is actually a pretty difficult plot point to use. The setting is more or less built for a default of &quot;What matters is that she's gone, the 'why' is unimportant,&quot; and so the basic structure of the setting doesn't really give you much help when it comes to providing an explanation. The simpler explanations (Lunar assassins, Gold Faction assassins, fell afoul of something in the Imperial Manse's basement, etc.) feel small and unsatisfying in the face of her larger-than-life character, but the more grandiose plots have a tendency to blossom into something campaign-consuming like the 2E-canon Return.<br /> <br /> I suppose it may be useful, however, to recall that numerous leaders in real-world history show that glorious lives do not always lead to glorious deaths. Both Alexander and Attila are good examples of that.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/21733-ascension","name":"Ascension","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar21733_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-28T22:49:22-07:00","id":1249620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katamari_Naneke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress#post1249261\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Where is the Scarlet Empress?<br /> Ok, what I'm getting at is, what ideas did people have about where the Empress was back before it was defined in canon?</div> </div> </div> </div>Even before it became canon, since Exalted 1e/2e was strongly hinted to be the prehistory of the World of Darkness, the usual speculation was that the Scarlet Empress was the same person as the Vampire: Kindred of the East entity the Scarlet Queen. And as that entity was the wife of the KotE Ebon Dragon, her disappearance was linked to the Yozi of the same name. This was seen as particularly likely because of the cycle of the Ages -- Exalted was set in the Second Age on the cusp of a transition to a Third, while in KotE the Scarlet Queen and the Ebon Dragon presided over the Ten Thousand Heroes in the Third Age. So alternative explanations were always 'alternative', there was the expectation that the 'real' story was the one that was eventually canonized.<br /> <br /> So speculation of alternatives now is actually freer than it ever was, since we know the 3e design explicitly doesn't have a 'hidden truth'.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":572,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/572-verzio","user":"Verzio","date":". 08-29-2018, 01:54 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/572-verzio","name":"Verzio","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar572_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T03:34:44-07:00","id":1249660,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ascension</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1249615#post1249615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I suppose it may be useful, however, to recall that numerous leaders in real-world history show that glorious lives do not always lead to glorious deaths. Both Alexander and Attila are good examples of that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or the &quot;Flower of English Chivalry!&quot; <a href=\"http://www.harkavagrant.com/index.php?id=353\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.harkavagrant.com/index.php?id=353</a><br /> <br /> I'd forgotten that bit about Exalted being the prehistory of the World of Darkness. I never liked the idea, it seemed like mixing cake into pasta sauce. I mean, I've enjoyed WoD games as well, but that comparison just felt like White Wolf reminding everyone that there was this other game line that they could buy. Obviously it's fine if people are into it, but now you remind me of it I'm gonna chalk it up as a strike against the Reclamation in my own approach.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T20:20:12-07:00","id":1249865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cheshire Cat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1249357#post1249357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my game she stepped through some kind of portal within the Sword or Creation and is gone. Elsewhere, Zen-Mu, who gives a shit, important is: she's gone and there is no way of telling if and when she'll be back which creates exactly the atmosphere I wanted at my table. Your mileage may vary.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> good use of this: when she does return, it weas only about an hour to her. she'll be shocked by how much time passed on this side","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-29T21:08:21-07:00","id":1249872,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cheshire Cat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1249357#post1249357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In my game she stepped through some kind of portal within the Sword or Creation and is gone. Elsewhere, Zen-Mu, who gives a shit, important is: she's gone and there is no way of telling if and when she'll be back which creates exactly the atmosphere I wanted at my table. Your mileage may vary.</div> </div> </div> </div>I like the idea of her going to Zenmu that may be a cool idea I steal so she does return. Also maybe she goes to Malfeas not as a slave Bride but a normal bride, so she retains her agency and just has greater political power and weird relatives. Also they each own half of each other\u2019s stuff.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T04:19:18-07:00","id":1249927,"title":"","content":"Personally, I'm partial to the idea of her permission to use the Sword of Creation back during the Balorian Crusade being the result of a program in the Sword that basically says 'if a Big Thing is going down and the Sword is needed RIGHT NOW, people normally not allowed to use it may do so, but they will be later erased if an authorized user doesn't then come and verify them within X amount of time'. The Empress said yes, used the Sword, and then managed to trick it for 760-odd years, but eventually she missed a step and it realized that that authorization was long overdue, and the next time she entered the Imperial Manse she got dusted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T06:00:02-07:00","id":1249943,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1249927#post1249927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Personally, I'm partial to the idea of her permission to use the Sword of Creation back during the Balorian Crusade being the result of a program in the Sword that basically says 'if a Big Thing is going down and the Sword is needed RIGHT NOW, people normally not allowed to use it may do so, but they will be later erased if an authorized user doesn't then come and verify them within X amount of time'. The Empress said yes, used the Sword, and then managed to trick it for 760-odd years, but eventually she missed a step and it realized that that authorization was long overdue, and the next time she entered the Imperial Manse she got dusted.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I like this idea - To make it seem more magical than computer code, it would be easy to say that the Imperial Manse originally found her &quot;worthy&quot; and then after 7\u00bd centuries of political bargaining or what have you, it no longer did. Same effect for each scenario, but different aesthetics depending on what you like <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/684-jens-ole-knudsen","name":"Jens Ole Knudsen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T07:36:46-07:00","id":1249963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Jens Ole Knudsen</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1249943#post1249943\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> I like this idea - To make it seem more magical than computer code, it would be easy to say that the Imperial Manse originally found her &quot;worthy&quot; and then after 7\u00bd centuries of political bargaining or what have you, it no longer did. Same effect for each scenario, but different aesthetics depending on what you like <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>That actually works better than my thought, especially with 3e's (excellent, in my opinion) move away from the 'sci-fi'-ey stuff.<br /> <br /> The important things, in my eyes, about the disappearance of the Scarlet Empress are that:<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>She's not here to run the Realm.</li> <li>She didn't plan whatever caused her to be away (because otherwise she'd have left <i>some</i> provision for when she's gone.</li> <li>People can't be sure she's not coming back.</li> </ol>I personally like her being dead, because I personally prefer the 'Realm collapses into feuding territories that you have to deal with individually' plotline over the 'Realm reunifies after a brief period of instability' plotline, but that's just me. <br /> <br /> I'm a fan of <i>A Song of Ice and Fire. </i>Sue me. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 08-30-2018, 10:44 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-30T20:24:57-07:00","id":1250155,"title":"","content":"my favorite personal theory (as in I made it) is also that she is dead. But not by the RDG (can we do away with the Sword of Creation this edition? at least as is. i never liked it). <br /> <br /> She was murdered, then evidence of the killing disposed of. The goal is to weaken the Realm, the largest organization of Exalts and defenders of Creation, with a slow burn. Instead of the instant sucession crisis that would result from a dead body, this way the conflict is delayed, allowing the degradation to proceed more without any resolution that would allow for rebuilding.<br /> <br /> And no, it's not the Lunars. they're also targets of another similar scheme. This threat is trying to weaken or neutralize all groups who could effectivly defend Creation. With the Realm weakened, the Lunars as well, other powers are too regional. All that needs done if to effect the plan against the Beaurea of Destiny and then no one will be able to st<br /> <br /> Where did all these shiny people come from?!<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T02:29:00-07:00","id":1251587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1249963#post1249963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">2.She didn't plan whatever caused her to be away (because otherwise she'd have left <i>some</i> provision for when she's gone.</div> </div> </div> </div>In that game I mentioned earlier, it turned out that her provision for while she was gone was Tepet Fokuf. He was a master manipulator ordered to keep the Great Houses from taking the throne, and all his hilarious incompetence was a cover for managing the escalation of their ambitions for the throne. It didn't come up that much in character, but it made me chuckle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24421,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","user":"Katamari_Naneke","date":". 09-05-2018, 05:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T05:21:43-07:00","id":1251629,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katamari_Naneke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251587#post1251587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In that game I mentioned earlier, it turned out that her provision for while she was gone was Tepet Fokuf. He was a master manipulator ordered to keep the Great Houses from taking the throne, and all his hilarious incompetence was a cover for managing the escalation of their ambitions for the throne. It didn't come up that much in character, but it made me chuckle.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is amusing. Also amusing is the fact that so many people seem to look at Fokuf and go <i>He can't </i>really<i> be that stupid, surely. Surely he has to be some kind of master manipulator</i>.<br /> <br /> I ran a game once where the players (Dragonblooded) were <i>convinced</i> that Fokuf was exactly that kind of person, and spent ages trying to hint to him that they knew, they could be trusted and so on, first via letters and then by other means (this is while doing other stuff, mind you, it wasn't their sole focus). I almost went along with it, but then eventually decided that no, it would be funnier for them to be simply wrong. I mean, they made <i>so many</i> Read Intentions rolls and such, and they were just <i>so convinced</i> that even when I came out and basically said &quot;He's literally just an idiot&quot; they were certain there was something more to him, and all because of an NPC's botch way back near the beginning (they didn't know it was a botch).<br /> <br /> That was a good game. Sure, the Realm fell into civil war, and then we had to move onto a different game for reasons, but it was great fun. Their faces at the end of it all were <i>priceless</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T06:19:01-07:00","id":1251641,"title":"","content":"I have to admit, that sounds even better.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T06:34:25-07:00","id":1251648,"title":"","content":"While I got into Exalted after all of 2e had been released, the idea of Her Redness being kidnapped by Ebby was probably the first thing I threw out from the setting.<br /> <br /> For the game I ran, I decided she had been teleported to the northwestern corner of the Scavenger Lands. Her last memory being of how she had defied her father and deserted, to join a desperate attempt to get into the Forbidden Manse. Thanks to nothing really being known about the Empress, and all the myth-making, she is convinced that was somebody else and that she failed both her friends and her father.<br /> <br /> Full of shame and survivors guilt, she keeps the fact she is a Dragon Blood a secret, and works at a tea house in a remote village.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2839,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2839-lundgren","user":"Lundgren","date":"... 09-05-2018, 09:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2839-lundgren","name":"Lundgren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T07:07:18-07:00","id":1251654,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lundgren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251648#post1251648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I got into Exalted after all of 2e had been released, the idea of Her Redness being kidnapped by Ebby was probably the first thing I threw out from the setting.<br /> <br /> For the game I ran, I decided she had been teleported to the northwestern corner of the Scavenger Lands. Her last memory being of how she had defied her father and deserted, to join a desperate attempt to get into the Forbidden Manse. Thanks to nothing really being known about the Empress, and all the myth-making, she is convinced that was somebody else and that she failed both her friends and her father.<br /> <br /> Full of shame and survivors guilt, she keeps the fact she is a Dragon Blood a secret, and works at a tea house in a remote village.</div> </div> </div> </div>...I am reminded distinctly of Iroh, or Zuko's mother whose name escapes me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T07:53:21-07:00","id":1251665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251654#post1251654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...I am reminded distinctly of Iroh, or Zuko's mother whose name escapes me.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had to google the names. I'm planning to watch Avatar: the last airbender in Spanish as a part of learning the language, but I haven't got far enough yet to be able to watch it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2839-lundgren","name":"Lundgren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T08:14:31-07:00","id":1251670,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251654#post1251654\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...I am reminded distinctly of Iroh, or Zuko's mother whose name escapes me.</div> </div> </div> </div>The name is Ursa.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T08:25:47-07:00","id":1251673,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251629#post1251629\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also amusing is the fact that so many people seem to look at Fokuf and go <i>He can't </i>really<i> be that stupid, surely. Surely he has to be some kind of master manipulator</i>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Considering the people who end up in charge sometimes, I consider it less &quot;amusing&quot; and more &quot;depressingly na\u00efve.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T09:01:34-07:00","id":1251681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lundgren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251648#post1251648\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I got into Exalted after all of 2e had been released, the idea of Her Redness being kidnapped by Ebby was probably the first thing I threw out from the setting.<br /> <br /> For the game I ran, I decided she had been teleported to the northwestern corner of the Scavenger Lands. Her last memory being of how she had defied her father and deserted, to join a desperate attempt to get into the Forbidden Manse. Thanks to nothing really being known about the Empress, and all the myth-making, she is convinced that was somebody else and that she failed both her friends and her father.<br /> <br /> Full of shame and survivors guilt, she keeps the fact she is a Dragon Blood a secret, and works at a tea house in a remote village.</div> </div> </div> </div> Cue shenanigans when anyone with measure the wind or anything like that shows up. <br /> <br /> &quot;Hah. A dragonblooded. Let's see.... BY THE UNCONQUERED SUN, ESSENCE 8?! RUN RUN RUN!!!&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T17:24:22-07:00","id":1251792,"title":"","content":"^Bet that would come as a surprise to her too","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T18:55:00-07:00","id":1251808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251792#post1251792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">^Bet that would come as a surprise to her too</div> </div> </div> </div>And the husband and children she's going to get soon. <br /> <br /> What's a dragonblooded story without family drama?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T22:11:50-07:00","id":1251834,"title":"","content":"oh, please tell me she's marrying an Anathema","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T22:29:56-07:00","id":1251836,"title":"","content":"In my game she went out to the faraway to find Gaia and negotiate for power to stand before the solar exalted using Gaias fear of the solars to do so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1151-walkingeye","name":"WalkingEye","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1151_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"403"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-05T23:47:02-07:00","id":1251848,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251834#post1251834\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">oh, please tell me she's marrying an Anathema</div> </div> </div> </div>Bah. Too cliche. Make her husband a secret supporter of the cult of the illuminated. Or a rebel against the realm.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T01:19:44-07:00","id":1251864,"title":"","content":"Or a Gold Faction Sidereal who's keeping an eye on her<br /> <br /> Edit: or...a new type of Exalt who's not native to Creation. scouts for a new force on it's way in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T01:35:21-07:00","id":1251865,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251864#post1251864\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or a Gold Faction Sidereal who's keeping an eye on her<br /> <br /> Edit: or...a new type of Exalt who's not native to Creation. scouts for a new force on it's way in.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know what? Still too little family drama.<br /> <br /> Make it one of her descendants.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T03:55:37-07:00","id":1251876,"title":"","content":"A mortal descendant destined to become a Sidereal, who'll then join the Gold Faction?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T04:04:08-07:00","id":1251880,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katamari_Naneke</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251876#post1251876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A mortal descendant destined to become a Sidereal, who'll then join the Gold Faction?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah. Now it is a proper soap opera. <br /> <br /> Now we need a romantic rival. And a few rebellions.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T04:35:33-07:00","id":1251883,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251880#post1251880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ah. Now it is a proper soap opera. <br /> <br /> Now we need a romantic rival.</div> </div> </div> </div>Like an alien Exalted?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-06T11:53:15-07:00","id":1251966,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1251883#post1251883\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Like an alien Exalted?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah. <br /> <br /> Raksi.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-07T03:41:26-07:00","id":1252163,"title":"","content":"thought: was this done to er by accident? as an attack?<br /> <br /> or was this done by someone trying to protect her","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1047-vampire-hunter-d","name":"vampire hunter D","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1047_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1727"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-07T04:04:07-07:00","id":1252168,"title":"","content":"Do you know, I never even thought about what happened. I kind of like the idea that nobody knows! A great mystery. If a character was playing the ultimate magistrate detective type though, I'd seriously consider making it their ultimate case.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/117-solar","name":"Solar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar117_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1267"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-07T05:07:39-07:00","id":1252182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1252163#post1252163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">thought: was this done to er by accident? as an attack?<br /> <br /> or was this done by someone trying to protect her</div> </div> </div> </div>Accident. More exciting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-08T16:04:23-07:00","id":1252618,"title":"","content":"Prior to the release from the Jade Prison, there were still a few unbound Solar Exaltations. I had her youngest non-DB son Exalt as a Solar Eclipse. He fled when he realized what he was. She pursued without telling anyone what she was doing. After a while, he realized she wasn't pursuing anymore. But nobody knew what had happened to her, only that she's been missing for quite some time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/15.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2104-tenkage","name":"Tenkage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2104_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-09T02:59:41-07:00","id":1252709,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>vampire hunter D</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1252163#post1252163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">thought: was this done to er by accident? as an attack?<br /> <br /> or was this done by someone trying to protect her</div> </div> </div> </div>For my game, it was Chejop Kejak trying to clean up some potential future problem, as he didn't thought his successors would be able to handle the Empress. The plan was to kill her in a way that wouldn't create a powerful ghost. As she disappeared from Fate, and no indication of her being in the Underworld, he thought he was successful (he was aiming for a civil war, just not one where there also are a lot of Solars running around in Creation).<br /> <br /> Thanks to her keeping a low profile, so no ripples in the Loom, and Solars popping up everywhere, no one have noticed the new thread in the Loom.<br /> <br /> She knows she has somehow more power than before, but she thinks that's Wyld taint from when she was gone.<br /> <br /> While there is a small chance I might be able to resurrect this particular game, I'm currently counting it as dead. <br /> <br /> The plans I had for her... Well, I'm running sandboxy games, so it depends on a lot of what happens around her and how she perceive it.<br /> <br /> If she believes the world is safe (or safer without her, or she won't matter anyway) and there is no risk she won't have a wyld abomination as an offspring (or feel she would be able to &quot;handle&quot; it), she might start a family. If someone comes along and she perceives them to be a threat, she might deal with them. It might be the PCs, it might be a bunch of entitled DBs hunting the PCs, or something completely different. Sooner or later, things will change for her, because in a few years she can't stick around and pretend to be a mere mortal as she doesn't age as one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2839-lundgren","name":"Lundgren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-09T03:54:41-07:00","id":1252712,"title":"","content":"Wait. Game? This is interesting. Tell us more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-09T10:13:58-07:00","id":1252793,"title":"","content":"Not sure how much more there is to tell about the Empress in my game. She is mainly a NPC that I kept track of, because even if she isn't becoming directly involved, she can still makes ripples that affect the PCs.<br /> <br /> In my game, she was a low ranking officer in a force lead by her father. She became an officer due to family expectations, but it was sorcery she was interested in; and a nerd when it comes to the Forbidden Manse. So when a hero (a person with a load of destinies from the Sids) put together a team to breach the place, one in the team mentioned he knew someone that had read a lot about the place.<br /> <br /> When she brought it up with her father, he refused her to leave as he needed everyone if they would be able to hold, and releasing whatever the Forbidden Manse might hold would be even worse than just rolling over for the Wyld invasion. The result of their little discussion ended with him telling her that if she abandoned her post, she was no daughter of her. As the country she came from was part of the land lost to the Wyld, she honored her father's &quot;last wish&quot; by giving up her name. So instead she instead used the nickname her compatriots gave her on the way to the Manse; Scarlet.<br /> <br /> She was never meant to save the world. She was just lucky enough to do it. So the smart scheming leader of the group breaking the Manse, and officially disappeared a couple of years after she showed up on a field, obviously has to be another person in her mind.<br /> <br /> The father of one of the PCs, a high ranking DB officer that died in the Great Contagion, might have known the Empress father. I haven't decided they knew each other or how well, but both fathers were higher ranking Shogunate officers in roughly the same area. As the PC's newly exalted Dragon-Blooded brother is being raised to lead and rule in the old ways of the Shogunate, that might draw her Redness attention at some point.<br /> <br /> The game was only a few sessions in when it went on hiatus/went belly up. But even if I can't revive that game, I might reuse quite a bit of those ideas for the Empress if I ever get another game going.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2839-lundgren","name":"Lundgren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-10T13:50:32-07:00","id":1253126,"title":"","content":"Heh... Looks like I will be talking with the player mentioned in my previous post later this week. Her husband have also mentioned he might be interested in joining the game. So I might find out what her Redness will end up doing <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2839-lundgren","name":"Lundgren","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-11T02:02:33-07:00","id":1253236,"title":"","content":"Two theories:<br /> <br /> 1: She's retired peacefully somewhere in the threshold, living a normal life incognito. (My personal headcanon)<br /> <br /> 2: Whatever force was fueling her longevity finally gave out, and she died of old age. The years caught up to her body immediately after her death, and she crumbled to dust.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>She/Her pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12975-zealot_vedas","name":"Zealot_Vedas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12975_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-12T01:02:59-07:00","id":1253518,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Zealot_Vedas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1249261-where-was-the-scarlet-empress?p=1253236#post1253236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Two theories:<br /> <br /> 1: She's retired peacefully somewhere in the threshold, living a normal life incognito. (My personal headcanon)<br /> <br /> 2: Whatever force was fueling her longevity finally gave out, and she died of old age. The years caught up to her body immediately after her death, and she crumbled to dust.</div> </div> </div> </div>This makes me want to do an opposite angle where here longevity is running strong but she is becoming more and more worried about the gap in prowess between her and her dynasty starting to shrink as her scions grow. So she spent 1k+ spiritual journey in Zenmu/Beyond/Faraway to work on developing some edges to distance herself from the other Dragonblooded, as well as work on methods to get one over the Sidereals that try to reign her in, and perhaps most of all work on a method to sustain her dominance without relying on the Sword of Creation which is finally showing signs of sputtering and essentially will cause an apocalypse on the Blessed Isle if used.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-09-17T05:50:10-07:00","id":1254979,"title":"","content":"I remember an idea on rpg.net. <br /> <br /> The sword of creation was for defending Creation itself from any threat. Any threat. And here's the catch. <br /> <br /> Even a mortal can open it, as long as her motivation was 'protect creation'. <br /> <br /> When the Scarlet Empress entered it, so long ago, her desire was only to protect Creation. To halt the Balorian Crusade and weld the Dragonblooded together into a single whole to smash apart the monsters. <br /> <br /> But then, years and years of politicking, of court, of despotism, has changed her motivation to 'ensure the continuation of the Scarlet Dynasty' or 'protect the realm'. And now the Sword no longer opens for her. <br /> <br /> You want to find the Scarlet Empress? Don't look in the Threshold or Malfeas. She's on Mount Meru, gazing upon the entirety of Creation using the most powerful Awareness Charms she has, trying to change her motivation so that she can use the Sword again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}